{
  "ruleId": "DED-NPS-EMPLOYER-NEW-TAX-REGIME",
  "_note": "\"Where the total income of the assessee is chargeable to tax under section 202(1), the provisions of sub-section (1) shall have effect as if for \"10%\" referred to in clause (b) of that sub-section, \"14%\" had been substituted\" (s.124(2), p.160): an employer other than a Government, in the new regime. Base SALARY (s.124(13)(b)). Survives the new regime (s.202(2)(a)(xii)). TY 2026-27 only (D-129 C2a). rulebook DED-NPS-EMP-002, -003. OQ-14. The 1961 counterpart, s.80CCD(2), is unread (W-075d).",
